**Title:** "Whispers of the Shoreline: A Tranquil Journey with Theo and Nori"

**Description:** Drift into a serene slumber with Theo, an imaginative eleven-year-old boy, as he embarks on a poetic journey along a peaceful coastal shoreline with his delightful sea otter companion, Nori. Together, they explore the timeless beauty of the ocean, discovering treasures of gratitude and appreciation nestled within the sands. Bathed in the gentle hues of a setting sun, Theo learns to embrace the simple joys of life, fostering a deep sense of peace and calm. This soothing audio narrative is carefully crafted to help you ease into relaxation, relieving anxiety and inviting tranquil dreams. Allow the calming rhythms of the ocean and the quiet companionship of Theo and Nori to carry you into a restful night’s sleep.

